---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ""
description: "Do you own your music and want to play it anywhere? Cueport reads Serato or builds a library directly from your music files. It syncs music and metadata to your phone over the local network. Now you can play music, add cues, and edit sets on all your devices!"
homeMain: true
---

<div class="home-page">
  {% include "partials/section-buckets.njk" %}
  <section class="home-hero">
    {% include "partials/hero-waveform.njk" %}
    <div class="container home-hero-inner home-hero-inner--single">
      <div class="home-copy">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">LOCAL-FIRST SOFTWARE</p>
        <h1 class="home-title"><span class="home-title-line">A portable</span><span class="home-title-line">workstation</span><span class="home-title-line">for DJs</span></h1>
        <p class="home-intro home-sub"><strong class="home-question-inline">{{ site.homeQuestion }}</strong> {{ site.homeDescription }}</p>
        <div class="home-actions" aria-label="Primary actions">
          <div class="home-social">
          <span class="home-social-label">Follow us <span class="social-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
          {% for item in site.social %}
            <a class="app-btn app-btn--social" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{ item.ariaLabel }}">
              {% if item.icon == "instagram" %}
                <svg viewBox="2 2 20 20" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
                  <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
                </svg>
              {% elif item.icon == "youtube" %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="none">
                  <path fill="currentColor" d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
                </svg>
              {% elif item.icon == "substack" %}
                <svg viewBox="-2 -2 28 28" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="none">
                  <path d="M22.539 8.242H1.46V5.406h21.08v2.836zM1.46 10.812V24L12 18.11 22.54 24V10.812H1.46zM22.54 0H1.46v2.836h21.08V0z" fill="currentColor"/>
                </svg>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-section--local" aria-labelledby="local-title">
    <div class="container home-section-grid">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">WHY LOCAL-FIRST</p>
        <h2 id="local-title">Your library should travel with you.</h2>
        <p>Cueport is for people who own their music and want it available beyond one laptop. Tracks, cues, crates, and notes move between your devices, so listening, prep, and playback can happen wherever you are.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="benefit-grid">
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M4 9h4l6-5v16l-6-5H4z"/><path d="M18 8c1.4 1.1 2 2.4 2 4s-.6 2.9-2 4"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Original files, original sound</h3>
            <p>Cueport plays your actual files, not a compressed stream. What you hear on iPhone is what you hear on your Mac.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"/><path d="M8.5 16.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"/><path d="M12 20h.01"/><path d="M3 4l18 18"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Plays without the internet</h3>
            <p>Synced collections keep playing at a basement club, on a flight, or anywhere the signal drops.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><rect x="4" y="5" width="6" height="14"/><rect x="14" y="7" width="6" height="10"/><path d="M10 12h4"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Syncs over your network</h3>
            <p>Cueport sends tracks over the local connection that's most convenient: private Wi-Fi, Mac Internet Sharing, or iPhone Personal Hotspot.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.6-2.8 8-7 10-4.2-2-7-5.4-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Private by default</h3>
            <p>Your library syncs directly between your devices over your local network. Cueport does not upload it to an external server.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-section--workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
    {% include "partials/workflow-waveform.njk" %}
    <div class="container home-section-grid">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">SET UP</p>
        <h2 id="workflow-title">Set up in three steps.</h2>
        <p>Use Serato or Cueport Direct on your Mac, then send selected collections to iPhone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="setup-flow setup-flow--desktop setup-algorithm">
        <svg class="setup-diagram" viewBox="0 30 1360 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="setup-diagram-title setup-diagram-desc">
          <title id="setup-diagram-title">Cueport setup algorithm</title>
          <desc id="setup-diagram-desc">Install Cueport for Mac, choose either a Serato library or Cueport Direct with trail mix analysis, then connect your iPhone.</desc>
          <defs>
            <marker id="setup-diagram-arrowhead" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="4.4" markerHeight="4.4" orient="auto">
              <path d="M 2.5 2.5 L 8 5 L 2.5 7.5" />
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <g class="setup-diagram-links">
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--choice" d="M 320 250 H 386" />
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--source" d="M 532 250 C 580 250 565 125 620 125" />
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--source" d="M 532 250 C 580 250 565 375 620 375" />
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--finish" d="M 930 125 C 990 125 980 250 1040 250" />
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--finish" d="M 930 375 C 990 375 980 250 1040 250" />
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--start" transform="translate(0 185)">
            <rect width="320" height="130" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="18" y="20" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="35" y="42" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="72" y="36">Get Cueport for Mac</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="66">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">Install the app on</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="24">your Mac.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-decision setup-diagram-card--choice" transform="translate(390 179)">
            <path d="M 71 0 L 142 71 L 71 142 L 0 71 Z" />
            <text x="71" y="65" text-anchor="middle">
              <tspan x="71" dy="0">Choose a</tspan>
              <tspan x="71" dy="20">library</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--source" transform="translate(620 40)">
            <rect width="310" height="170" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="18" y="20" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="35" y="42" text-anchor="middle">2A</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="72" y="36">Serato library</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="66">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">Use your</tspan>
            </text>
            <rect class="setup-diagram-code-bg" x="72" y="76" width="92" height="26" rx="2" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-code" x="80" y="95">_Serato_</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="126">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">folder to build your</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="24">Cueport library.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--source" transform="translate(620 290)">
            <rect width="310" height="170" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="18" y="20" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="35" y="42" text-anchor="middle">2B</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="72" y="36">Cueport Direct</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="66">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">Build directly from</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="24">your music files.</tspan>
              <a href="https://github.com/djpardis/trailmix" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><tspan class="setup-diagram-link-label" x="72" dy="24">trail mix</tspan></a><tspan class="setup-diagram-body-normal"> analyzes</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="24">BPM, key, waveform.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--finish" transform="translate(1040 155)">
            <rect width="320" height="190" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="18" y="20" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="35" y="42" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="72" y="36">Connect your iPhone</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="66">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">Sync selected</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="26">collections to</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="26">your phone.</tspan>
            </text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-note" x="72" y="158">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">Available separately</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="18">on the App Store.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="setup-flow setup-flow--mobile setup-algorithm-mobile">
        <svg class="setup-diagram setup-diagram--mobile" viewBox="0 0 400 720" role="img" aria-labelledby="setup-mobile-diagram-title setup-mobile-diagram-desc">
          <title id="setup-mobile-diagram-title">Cueport mobile setup algorithm</title>
          <desc id="setup-mobile-diagram-desc">Install Cueport for Mac, choose either a Serato library or Cueport Direct with trail mix analysis, then connect your iPhone.</desc>
          <defs>
            <marker id="setup-mobile-diagram-arrowhead" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="4.4" markerHeight="4.4" orient="auto">
              <path d="M 2.5 2.5 L 8 5 L 2.5 7.5" />
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <g class="setup-diagram-links setup-diagram-links--mobile">
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--source" d="M 200 96 V 138" />
            <path class="setup-diagram-link setup-diagram-link--finish" d="M 200 550 V 588" />
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--start" transform="translate(40 0)">
            <rect width="320" height="96" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="18" y="20" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="35" y="42" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="72" y="36">Get Cueport for Mac</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="66">Install the app on your Mac.</text>
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--source" transform="translate(40 140)">
            <rect width="320" height="410" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="28" y="38">Choose a library</text>
            <rect class="setup-diagram-option" x="20" y="70" width="280" height="150" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="38" y="96" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="55" y="118" text-anchor="middle">2A</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="92" y="112">Serato library</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="92" y="142">
              <tspan x="92" dy="0">Use your</tspan>
            </text>
            <rect class="setup-diagram-code-bg" x="92" y="152" width="92" height="26" rx="2" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-code" x="100" y="171">_Serato_</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="92" y="200">folder to build your library.</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-or" x="160" y="252" text-anchor="middle">OR</text>
            <rect class="setup-diagram-option" x="20" y="276" width="280" height="118" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="38" y="298" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="55" y="320" text-anchor="middle">2B</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="92" y="314">Cueport Direct</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="92" y="342">
              <tspan x="92" dy="0">Build directly from your</tspan>
              <tspan x="92" dy="24">music files.</tspan>
              <a href="https://github.com/djpardis/trailmix" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><tspan class="setup-diagram-link-label" x="92" dy="24">trail mix</tspan></a><tspan class="setup-diagram-body-normal"> analyzes.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
          <g class="setup-diagram-card setup-diagram-card--finish" transform="translate(40 590)">
            <rect width="320" height="122" />
            <rect class="setup-diagram-badge" x="18" y="20" width="34" height="34" />
            <text class="setup-diagram-marker" x="35" y="42" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-title" x="72" y="36">Connect your iPhone</text>
            <text class="setup-diagram-body" x="72" y="66">
              <tspan x="72" dy="0">Sync selected collections</tspan>
              <tspan x="72" dy="24">to your phone.</tspan>
            </text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
